    "description": "The young hrim troll is a large troll resembling a large king troll, but with small tusks. Its thick tusks protrude from its mouth, still light and short. Thick hair on its skull continues down its back as a mane, and it also has a beard. Its body has absorbed cold for so long that it constantly releases it into its surroundings. It still stands upright and walks in a less bestial fashion.",
